All these things that
surround your our environment,

00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:59.120
these are the things that
we get really excited about.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:00.020
We have a great team.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:01.353
You might have seen us surround.

00:01:01.353 --> 00:01:05.390
The team members are Sean,
Edgar, Cole, Andre, James,

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:07.430
Kelly, Chris, and Alex.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.400
And we hang out in
